# Push CMS changes immediately

Whenever files in this CMS repo (`popi_solitaire_cms`) are modified (HTML/JS/CSS/rules/README/etc.):

1. Commit the CMS changes.
2. `git push` to `origin` on the current branch right away.
3. Return the commit and remote URL when done.

Do not wait for the user to ask to push CMS updates. Unity game scripts outside this repo are not covered.
